 the backdrop of a thoughtfully curated three-course dinner with expertly p
 aired wines\, this unique experience invites members to connect through cu
 rated conversation prompts designed to spark engaging dialogue. Enjoy the 
 perfect blend of stimulating discussion\, exceptional company\, and a menu
