DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Available\n
 Event URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/181400\n\nSettle in for
  an evening with Becca Hannah\, whose soulful blend of R&B\, jazz\, blues\
 , and soul creates an atmosphere that is both intimate and transporting. G
 uided by instinct and emotion\, Becca crafts music that lingers long after
  the final note\, weaving themes of love\, longing\, and self-discovery in
 to every performance.\n\nDrawing from her debut album\, Tonight In My Drea
 ms\, Becca invites listeners into a richly textured sonic world where time
 less influences meet contemporary expression. Sip on a signature cocktail 
 from Little Bar and let the music carry you through an unforgettable eveni
 ng.\n\n*Reservations are not required. Seating is first come\, first serve
 d.
