SUMMARY:Author's Circle Book Club: "Summer of Love" with Kerri Maher
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 14 spots left\nS
 tatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/19531
 1\n\nBookmark the date for an inspiring conversation exploring “The Summ
 er of Love” with author Kerri Maher. Moderated by Wendy Dodson\, owner o
 f Humming Bird Books.\n\nSettle into the sand this month and let the Calif
 ornia coast carry you away. A story of family\, love\, ambition\, and long
 -buried secrets\, this is the perfect escape to pack in your beach bag thi
 s summer. Travel back to the Summer of Love in 1967\, where two sisters fi
 nd themselves on very different paths. Winnie dreams of changing the world
  through poetry in the heart of San Francisco's counterculture\, while Mir
 anda stays home to build her family's California vineyard into something e
 xtraordinary.\n\nFifty years later\, Dawn Hartley is pulled back into her 
 family's past when she sets out to uncover the identity of a mysterious be
 stselling author who seems to know all of the Hartleys' deepest secrets—
 including one Dawn is hiding herself.\n\n*This event is complimentary and 
 reserved for members only. Light refreshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/195311
CATEGORIES:The Arts
